WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,370
Uncle Qiao, what's going on?

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:04,370
My daughter is gone

3
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:06,370
Hit by a tricycle

4
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:07,370
There was chicken blood that day

5
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:08,370
Riding a tricycle is not fast

6
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:09,370
But the car owner said

7
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:10,370
The car arrived in front of my daughter

8
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,370
Suddenly it was like being covered by a piece of cloth

9
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,370
Can't see anything

10
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:14,370
The child fell on the snow and lost his breath.

11
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:16,370
My daughter is not even eighteen yet

12
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,370
God is unfair

13
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,370
Uncle Qiao, wait a minute

14
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,370
I'll talk to you

15
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:23,620
The meaning of existence for people like us

16
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,810
Just watching people die

17
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,870
But there is nothing you can do?

18
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:34,610
You haven't been sleeping well lately

19
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,860
Head turns blue in the morning

20
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:38,860
No matter what I do, I can’t remember my attention.

21
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,860
I've been having nightmares these days

22
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:44,910
It's not just a nightmare, right?

23
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:47,170
There are some other dreams

24
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,170
In my dream, there was a man who always said nice things.

25
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:51,170
let me find him

26
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:53,170
And gave me a phone number

27
00:00:53,170 --> 00:00:54,170
did you hit

28
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:55,650
As soon as I wake up

29
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:57,650
Engraved in my bones

30
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:58,650
I asked a friend to check

31
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:01,650
This phone number expired five years ago

32
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:02,650
This is Yin Taohua

33
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:03,940
You come today

34
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:06,480
It should be more than just this

35
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,480
I dreamed of him again last night

36
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,480
He said he wanted me to go with him

37
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,480
What should I do about big things?

38
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,960
I've been dreaming about this for a week

39
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,960
People have to be crazy
